        "original_id": "480a3c6f-063f-5edb-8b3e-51e01c9b5672",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Lion and the Horse\n- People: Louis King, Crane Wilbur, Steve Cochran, Ray Teal\n- Organizations: NBC\n- Roles: Sheriff Roy Coffee\n- Topics: Western films, Bonanza\n\nFacts:\n- The Lion and the Horse is a 1952 Western film.\n- Louis King directed The Lion and the Horse.\n- Crane Wilbur wrote The Lion and the Horse.\n- Steve Cochran starred in The Lion and the Horse.\n- Ray Teal starred in The Lion and the Horse.\n- A horse named Wildfire starred in The Lion and the Horse.\n- From 1960 to 1972, Ray Teal's longest-running role was Sheriff Roy Coffee on NBC's western series Bonanza.",
